  "description": "Dependency-injection registration for Ank.DocToolkit. services.AddDocToolkit() registers one\n      injectable interface per capability - conversion between HTML, Markdown, DOCX, PDF, XLSX and\n      PPTX, plus the DOCX/XLSX/PPTX/PDF editors - over the same pure-managed logic: no browser, no\n      Chromium, no native binaries, no LibreOffice. For ASP.NET Core and worker-service consumers.",
